{
    "title": "GoodRx: Prescription Coupons",
    "description": "The affordable healthcare and medication app \u2013 that\u2019s GoodRx. Get discount options for prescription drugs, perks when buying meds, and reliable telehealth services. Medication tracker, pill reminder, and more - enjoy an Rx app that brings complete virtual care to the palm of your hand-. Our free digital coupons can help you save more than savings from health insurance or Medicare.\r\n\r\nGoodRx was made with health equity in mind. Our free prescription discount finder has everything you need from personal medication tracker to pill reminder and rewards on prescriptions. Get healthcare benefits like Rx discounts on medicine, senior care, and more on the prescription drug savings app trusted by millions of Americans.\r\n\r\nEnjoy everything from medication reminder features to Rx savings solutions for a complete mobile health care app without insurance. Make the most of your healthcare with your own medication list, pill tracker, drug guide & price check. Monitor prescriptions easily with our medicine tracker and pill reminder. Save money with mobile Rx coupons & find a doctor on our personal healthcare app.\r\n\r\nDownload GoodRx today to save on your medication and become your own healthcare advocate!\r\n\r\nGoodRx Features:\r\n\r\nDigital Coupons at Over 70,000 Pharmacy Locations\r\n- CVS Pharmacy\r\n- Walmart Pharmacy\r\n- HEB Pharmacy\r\n- Walgreens Pharmacy\r\n- Rite Aid Pharmacy\r\n- Target Pharmacy\r\n- Safeway Pharmacy\r\n- Vons Pharmacy\r\n- Kroger Pharmacy\r\n- & more!\r\n\r\nMedication App With Prescriptions Up To 80% Off\r\n- Rx savings solutions: Find savings on drugs with our free coupons app\r\n- Check Rx pharmacy prices and redeem digital coupons to claim your prescription discount\r\n- Get an Rx app with free coupons that help you save money\r\n- Our health app offers discounts to save on pet meds to cover your furry friend\r\n- Discount finder for meds with mobile coupons you can use at a local pharmacy\r\n- Healthcare app with prescription medication discounts & patient assistance programs- Visit your preferred pharmacy or Rx discount location to save on meds\r\n\r\nMedication Reminder & Free Pill Tracker\r\n- Pill reminder: Our pill tracker makes refills easy thanks to medication reminder alerts\r\n- Medication tracker: Get a free drug guide to help manage medications\r\n- Pill tracker: Our medication reminder monitors prescription medications & more\r\n\r\nComplete Health Care Tool\r\n- Medication list with a drug guide for your prescriptions\r\n- Medicine tracker to help with daily prescriptions\r\n- Get affordable, virtual care now with online medical professionals\r\n- No Medicare, Medicaid, or health insurance needed \u2013 find a doctor seamlessly\r\n- Find telehealth care and understand your meds, and prescription list\r\n- Medication delivery & pickup available anywhere\r\n\r\nGoodRx Care services include\r\n- Birth control medication & refills\r\n- Urinary Tract Infection treatment\r\n- Erectile Dysfunction\r\n- Short term medication refills\r\n- & more\r\n\r\nPrescription Discount Finder Trusted by Millions\r\n- Digital coupons made easy for everyone\r\n- Our medication app shows the Rx pharmacy with savings on drugs\r\n- Healthcare professionals across the country use our coupons app to help patients save money\r\n- Featured by: The New York Times, PBS, ABC News, Forbes, CNN, Good Morning America, The LA Times & more!\r\n\r\nUpgrade to GoodRx Gold to earn rewards for additional discounts, benefits, and offers. Get exclusive pricing and reliable mobile health care with GoodRx Gold.\r\n\r\nBy downloading GoodRx, you agree to be bound by our Terms Of Use. Read more at http://www.goodrx.com/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nPlease visit https://www.goodrx.com/consumer-health-data-privacy-notice to read our Consumer Health Data Privacy Notice for additional information about our handling of consumer health data.\r\n\r\n*GoodRx works to make its apps accessible to all, including those with disabilities. If you are having difficulty accessing this application, please call or email us at (855) 268-2822 or ada@goodrx.com so that we can provide you with the services you require through alternative means",
